---
title: Sections
permalink: /styleguide/sections/index.html
description: Composable page sections — types and shared appearance options.
---

{% include "sections/_assets.njk" %}

<div class="styleguide-full__intro | wrapper region flow">
  <header class="intro flow">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p>
      Live Dyvenia copy below. Each demo is separated by a neutral note describing
      the section type. Shared options on every type:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>theme</strong> — full-bleed surface color (<code>white</code>, <code>gray-light</code>, <code>gray-dark</code>, <code>teal</code>, <code>purple</code>, <code>navy</code>). Named by color, not light/dark mode — site dark mode is separate and remaps soft bands toward dark greys. <code>gray-dark</code>/<code>navy</code> keep light text.</li>
      <li><strong>accent</strong> — CTA color. <code>default</code> follows the theme (neutral on white/grey; teal CTA on teal/purple; navy CTA on navy). Override with <code>neutral</code>, <code>teal</code>, <code>purple</code>, or <code>navy</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>align</strong> — <code>left</code> | <code>center</code> | <code>right</code></li>
      <li><strong>width</strong> — <code>content</code> | <code>feature</code> | <code>full</code></li>
    </ul>
  </header>

  <form class="sg-preview | cluster" aria-label="Preview theme and accent">
    <div class="sg-preview__field | cluster">
      <label for="sg-theme">Theme</label>
      <select id="sg-theme" data-sg-theme name="theme">
        <option value="white">white</option>
        <option value="gray-light">gray-light</option>
        <option value="gray-dark">gray-dark</option>
        <option value="teal">teal</option>
        <option value="purple">purple</option>
        <option value="navy">navy</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-preview__field | cluster">
      <label for="sg-accent">Accent</label>
      <select id="sg-accent" data-sg-accent name="accent">
        <option value="default">default (theme)</option>
        <option value="neutral">neutral</option>
        <option value="teal">teal</option>
        <option value="purple">purple</option>
        <option value="navy">navy</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="button" data-small-button data-sg-reset>Reset fixtures</button>
  </form>
</div>

{% set demoKeys = ["hero", "text", "highlight", "list", "process", "feature", "accordion", "cta", "posts", "team", "form", "services", "tabs", "cases", "gallery"] %}

<div data-sg-demos>
  {% asyncEach key in demoKeys %}
    {% set doc = sectionDemos.docs[key] %}
    <aside class="sg-section-doc | wrapper">
      <div class="feature | region flow prose">
        <p class="sg-section-doc__type"><code>{{ doc.title }}</code></p>
        <p>{{ doc.body }}</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    {% set sections = [sectionDemos[key]] %}
    {% include "sections/_render.njk" %}
  {% endeach %}
</div>

{% js "defer" %}
  {% include "scripts/styleguide-section-preview.js" %}
{% endjs %}
